focusflow (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * FocusFlow v0.3.0 major UI redesign and bugfix release:
    - Complete dark-glass dashboard redesign matching target reference.
    - Mountain sunset panorama hero banner with 4 real-data stat cards.
    - Multicolor circular timer display with Pomodoro, Short Break, and Long Break switcher.
    - Interactive monthly calendar card with database session indicator dots.
    - Donut task completion chart and 7-day purple gradient focus time bar chart.
    - Redesigned floating timer with fluid gradient waves, header dragging, and vector pushpin.
    - Redesigned task selection dialog (NoTaskDialog) with dark glass cards.
    - Midnight rollover bug fix automatically resetting completed pomodoro cycles.
    - Interrupted task focus time tracking on stopped/skipped sessions.
    - Fixed monotonic clock timer drift and suspend/resume handling.
    - Offline bundled local vector artwork (assets/tomato.svg, assets/hero_sunset.png).

 -- FocusFlow Contributors <focusflow@localhost>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:50:00 +0000

focusflow (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * FocusFlow v0.2.0 daily-driver release:
    - Drift-free timer engine with wall-clock sync, crash recovery, and suspend detection.
    - Floating timer polish with right-click context menu, auto-hide controls, and task switcher.
    - Dedicated session history view with date filtering and CSV export.
    - Daily goal progress bar, peak productivity insights, and longest streak records.
    - Persistent file logging to XDG state directory and in-app diagnostics log viewer.
    - Automated rolling database backups with 5-snapshot retention.
    - Interactive inactivity/idle recovery dialog.
    - CLI control flags (--start, --pause, --stop, --show).
    - GitHub Actions CI test and packaging workflows.

 -- FocusFlow Contributors <focusflow@localhost>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:15:00 +0000

focusflow (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of FocusFlow:
    - Drift-free Pomodoro timer engine.
    - Always-on-top draggable floating timer widget.
    - Persistent task management with priorities, tags, and pomodoro tracking.
    - Daily, weekly, and monthly productivity statistics and visual charts.
    - Native desktop notifications and system tray integration.
    - Offline local-first SQLite persistence with migrations and backups.

